{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"撒迦利亚书","commonName":"撒迦利亚书","title":"撒迦利亚书","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"8cf62f43a8ce797cc4cdd63e937097d1b0225901663353bd7ce9b6f60df7db51","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["四辆马车"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我又举目观看，见有四辆马车从两座铜山之间出来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["第一辆车套着红马，第二辆车套着黑马，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["第三辆车套着白马，第四辆车套着斑点马，马都很雄壮。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我问与我说话的天使：“主啊，这些马车是做什么的？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["天使说：“他们是侍立在天下之主面前的四灵",{"noteId":2},"，正在出发。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["套着黑马的车前往北方，套着白马的车前往西方",{"noteId":3},"，套着斑点马的车前往南方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["这些雄壮的马出来，迫不及待地要巡察大地。天使说：“你们去巡察大地吧！”它们便遵命而行。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他又高声对我说：“看啊，那些到北方去的已在那里使我的心得到安慰。”"]},{"type":"heading","content":["为约书亚加冕"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和华对我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["“被掳到巴比伦的黑玳、多比雅和耶大雅已经回来了，你要收集他们奉献的金银，并在当天去西番雅的儿子约西亚家。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["你要用这些金银制作冠冕，戴在约撒答的儿子约书亚大祭司头上，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["告诉他，万军之耶和华说，‘看啊，那被称为大卫苗裔的要从自己的地方兴起，建造耶和华的殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["祂必建造耶和华的殿，带着威荣坐在宝座上掌权，也必有祭司坐在宝座上",{"noteId":4},"，两者和谐共存。’"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["这冠冕要留在耶和华的殿中，作为对黑玳",{"noteId":5},"、多比雅、耶大雅和西番雅的儿子约西亚",{"noteId":6},"的纪念。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["远方的人也要来建造耶和华的殿。那时你们便知道，是万军之耶和华差遣我到你们这里来的。你们若全心遵从你们上帝耶和华的话，这事就必成就。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"“灵”或译“风”。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":5}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"“前往西方”或译“跟在后面”。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":6}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"“也必有祭司坐在宝座上”或译“也必坐在宝座上做祭司”。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":13}},{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"“黑玳”希伯来文作“希连”。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":14}},{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"“约西亚”希伯来文作“贤”，意思是“恩慈者”。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":14}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}